  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF preview.41 with immutable ProGPU preview.47; consumes compact retained picture commands, glyph/scalar/layer records, specialized single-run text blobs, and nonblocking reusable image readback without a bridge workaround; preserves the typed, zero-allocation ProGPU media drawing-state bridge, native activation, deterministic popup-local input, transparent X11/XWayland visuals, and nonactivating windows; bounds retained render-resource caches and suppresses static-frame GPU rendering; and retains native Cocoa popups, Windows OLE clipboard, seven-theme, WPFGallery, and SharpDevelop designer acceptance gates.",
